Butler, of course, is talking about Saturday[�]�s wide receiver workouts. If he cr[ushes] the drills, he could vault up the draft board — perhaps into the first round. And he feels well-prepared because he[’]s spent the past few months working out[ with some] legendary NFL receivers in Calvin Johnson and Anquan Boldin.
